---
// Benefits Component for Help Chat Bot
import TechGrid from './TechGrid.astro';
---

<section id="beneficios" class="benefits-section">
  <TechGrid type="grid" opacity={0.04} color="var(--color-secondary)" animate={true} />
  <div class="glow-effect" style="bottom: 10%; left: 5%; width: 450px; height: 450px; opacity: 0.1;"></div>
  
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="section-tagline text-gradient-primary">Benefícios de Elite</span>
      <h2>Tudo o que seu negócio precisa para <span class="text-gradient">profissionalizar</span> o atendimento</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Aumente as vendas, reduza tarefas manuais repetitivas e proporcione uma experiência incrível para seus pacientes e clientes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="benefits-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="benefit-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper" style="--card-glow-color: rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.4);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="card-icon text-secondary">
            <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Atendimento Ágil e Organizado</h3>
        <p>Respostas rápidas e automações inteligentes que tiram dúvidas de clientes instantaneamente, eliminando filas de espera e aumentando a satisfação.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="benefit-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper" style="--card-glow-color: rgba(3, 173, 61, 0.4);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="card-icon text-whatsapp">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
            <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
            <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
            <path d="M8 14h.01"></path>
            <path d="M12 14h.01"></path>
            <path d="M16 14h.01"></path>
            <path d="M8 18h.01"></path>
            <path d="M12 18h.01"></path>
            <path d="M16 18h.01"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="badge-featured">Ideal para Clínicas</div>
        <h3>Confirmações Automáticas</h3>
        <p>Redução drástica de faltas e otimização automática de agendas. O bot envia lembretes inteligentes aos pacientes e atualiza seu calendário em tempo real.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="benefit-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper" style="--card-glow-color: rgba(108, 93, 211, 0.4);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="card-icon text-accent">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Organização por Setores</h3>
        <p>Distribua automaticamente os atendimentos para os departamentos corretos (Financeiro, Comercial, Suporte, Agendamento) com apenas um clique do cliente.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="benefit-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper" style="--card-glow-color: rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.4);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="card-icon text-primary">
            <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line>
            <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Relatórios e Métricas</h3>
        <p>Acompanhe a performance dos atendentes, o volume de conversas diárias e taxas de conversão em tempo real para decisões estratégicas seguras.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="benefit-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.5s;">
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper" style="--card-glow-color: rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.4);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="card-icon text-secondary">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Segurança e Estabilidade</h3>
        <p>Servidores de alta confiabilidade em nuvem que rodam continuamente. Conexão oficial direta com a Meta sem necessidade de manter telefones ligados.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6 -->
      <div class="benefit-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 0.6s;">
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper" style="--card-glow-color: rgba(3, 173, 61, 0.4);">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="card-icon text-whatsapp">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Suporte Especializado</h3>
        <p>Equipe dedicada para desenhar os fluxos de mensagens, integrar com seus sistemas internos e dar todo o treinamento necessário para o seu time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .benefits-section {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
  }

  .section-tagline {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    padding: 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .benefit-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px var(--color-shadow), 0 0 25px rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.12);
  }

  .card-icon-wrapper {
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .card-icon-wrapper {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
  }

  .card-icon-wrapper::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--card-glow-color, rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.1));
    filter: blur(8px);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover .card-icon-wrapper::after {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .benefit-card:hover .card-icon-wrapper::after {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .card-icon {
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .text-secondary {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .text-whatsapp {
    color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .text-accent {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .text-primary {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .benefit-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .badge-featured {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    background: rgba(3, 173, 61, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(3, 173, 61, 0.3);
    color: #03AD3D;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 100px;
  }

  html[data-theme="light"] .badge-featured {
    background: rgba(3, 173, 61, 0.1);
    color: #028e30;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
